# The prime spectrum

Extensions of Mathlib's `RingTheory/Spectrum/Prime/`, where `PrimeSpectrum`
and `basicOpen` are defined: finite products of basic opens in the lattice of
opens, and the bridge from a unit-ideal generating family to an open-site cover.
These results are about topological prime spectra and need no scheme structure.
